══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
  NODE: comm.slack
  Category: comm
══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

  Send a Slack message to a channel or user

  Config example:
    { "credential_id": "slack-bot", "channel": "#news", "text": "{{ $json.summary }}" }

  Inputs:   item with message content
  Outputs:  ts (timestamp), channel

  ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  Credential platform: slack

  Fields (every operation):
    credential_id        Slack Connection · credential_picker · required
    operation            Operation · select · required · default="post_message"
                         shown when resource is (not set)
    resource             Resource · select · default="" · options: |message|channel|file|reaction|star|user|userGroup
                         Leave empty for the built-in operations; pick a resource for the Slack API package operations.
    operation            Message Operation · select · required · default="post"
                         shown when resource is message
    operation            Channel Operation · select · required · default="create"
                         shown when resource is channel
    operation            File Operation · select · required · default="upload"
                         shown when resource is file
    operation            Reaction Operation · select · required · default="add"
                         shown when resource is reaction
    operation            Star Operation · select · required · default="add"
                         shown when resource is star
    operation            User Operation · select · required · default="info"
                         shown when resource is user
    operation            User Group Operation · select · required · default="create"
                         shown when resource is userGroup
    select               Send to · select · default="channel" · options: channel|user
                         shown when resource is message
    channelId            Channel · text
                         Channel ID (or a resource locator)
                         shown when resource is message|channel|reaction|star
    user                 User · text
                         User ID (or a resource locator), when sending to a user
                         shown when resource is message|user
    messageType          Message type · select · default="text" · options: text|block|attachment
                         shown when resource is message
    text                 Text · textarea
                         Message text (with block: notification fallback text)
                         shown when resource is message
    blocksUi             Blocks · code
                         Block Kit JSON: {"blocks": [...]}
                         shown when resource is message
    attachments          Attachments · code
                         List of legacy attachments; fields as {"item": [{"title", "value", "short"}]}
                         shown when resource is message
    otherOptions         Other options · code · default={}
                         thread_ts: {"replyValues": {"thread_ts", "reply_broadcast"}}; botProfile: {"imageValues": {"profilePhotoType": "image|emoji", "icon_url", "icon_emoji"}}; ephemeral: {"ephemeralValues": {"user": "U123"}} (channel) or true (user) Keys: botProfile, ephemeral, link_names, mrkdwn, sendAsUser, thread_ts, unfurl_links, unfurl_media, includeLinkToWorkflow
                         shown when resource is message
    timestamp            Message timestamp · text
                         shown when resource is message|reaction|star
    scheduledMessageId   Scheduled message ID · text
                         shown when resource is message
    returnAll            Return all · boolean · default=false
                         shown when resource is message|channel|file|star|user|userGroup
    limit                Limit · number · default=50
                         shown when resource is message|channel|file|star|user|userGroup
    filters              Filters · code · default={}
                         Keys: channelId, latest, oldest
                         shown when resource is message
    postAt               Send at · text
                         e.g. 2026-01-31T09:00:00Z
                         shown when resource is message
    query                Search query · text
                         shown when resource is message
    sort                 Sort · select · default="desc" · options: desc|asc|relevance
                         shown when resource is message
    options              Options · code · default={}
                         searchChannel: list of channel names to search in Keys: searchChannel
                         shown when resource is message
    ts                   Message timestamp · text
                         shown when resource is message
    updateFields         Update fields · code · default={}
                         Keys: link_names, parse
                         shown when resource is message
    otherOptions         Other options · code · default={}
                         Keys: includeLinkToWorkflow
                         shown when resource is message
    channelVisibility    Visibility · select · default="public" · options: public|private
                         shown when resource is channel
    options              Options · code · default={}
                         Keys: includeNumMembers
                         shown when resource is channel
    filters              Filters · code · default={}
                         types: list of public_channel, private_channel, mpim, im Keys: excludeArchived, types
                         shown when resource is channel
    filters              Filters · code · default={}
                         Keys: inclusive, latest, oldest
                         shown when resource is channel
    userIds              User IDs · array
                         shown when resource is channel
    userId               User ID · text
                         shown when resource is channel
    resolveData          Resolve user details · boolean · default=false
                         shown when resource is channel
    options              Options · code · default={}
                         Keys: channelId, returnIm, users
                         shown when resource is channel
    name                 New name · text
                         shown when resource is channel
    ts                   Thread timestamp · text
                         shown when resource is channel
    purpose              Purpose · text
                         shown when resource is channel
    topic                Topic · text
                         shown when resource is channel
    binaryData           Upload binary data · boolean · default=true
                         shown when resource is file
    fileContent          File content · textarea
                         Text to upload when Upload binary data is off
                         shown when resource is file
    binaryPropertyName   Input binary property · text · default="data"
                         shown when resource is file
    options              Options · code · default={}
                         Keys: channelIds, channelId, fileName, initialComment, threadTs, title
                         shown when resource is file
    fileId               File ID · text
                         shown when resource is file|star
    filters              Filters · code · default={}
                         Keys: channelId, showFilesHidden, tsFrom, tsTo, types, userId
                         shown when resource is file
    name                 Emoji name · text
                         shown when resource is reaction
    target               Target · select · default="message" · options: message|file
                         shown when resource is star
    options              Options · code · default={}
                         Keys: fileComment
                         shown when resource is star
    options              Options · code · default={}
                         Keys: channelId, fileId, fileComment, timestamp
                         shown when resource is star
    email                Email · text
                         shown when resource is user
    options              Options · code · default={}
                         status: {"set_status": [{"status_emoji", "status_text", "status_expiration"}]}; customFieldUi: {"customFieldValues": [{"id", "value", "alt"}]} Keys: customFieldUi, email, first_name, last_name, status, user
                         shown when resource is user
    name                 Name · text
                         shown when resource is userGroup
    Options              Options · code · default={}
                         Keys: channelIds, description, handle, include_count
                         shown when resource is userGroup
    userGroupId          User group ID · text
                         shown when resource is userGroup
    options              Options · code · default={}
                         Keys: include_count
                         shown when resource is userGroup
    option               Options · code · default={}
                         Keys: include_count
                         shown when resource is userGroup
    options              Options · code · default={}
                         Keys: include_count, include_disabled, include_users
                         shown when resource is userGroup
    options              Options · code · default={}
                         resolveData (default true): return full user objects Keys: resolveData
                         shown when resource is userGroup
    updateFields         Update fields · code · default={}
                         Keys: channels, description, handle, include_count, name
                         shown when resource is userGroup
    users                User IDs · array
                         shown when resource is userGroup

  Operations (operation):
    post_message  (default)
      channel              Channel · resource_picker
                           Select a Slack channel.
      text                 Message Text · textarea
      blocks               Blocks (Block Kit JSON array) · code
                           Slack Block Kit blocks sent with the message; Message Text becomes the notification fallback. Give a JSON array in the workflow file, or an expression that yields one (e.g. {{ json $json.blocks }}).
    upload_file
      channel              Channel · resource_picker
                           Select a Slack channel.
      file_path            File Path · text
      filename             Filename · text
    list_channels
      no further fields
    get_user
      user_id              User ID · text

